<title>HONG KONG: China bans poultry from 10 US states - US official.</title>
<headline>China bans poultry from 10 US states - US official.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1996-10-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>China has banned all imports of poultry and poultry meat from 10 states of the United States, an official of the U.S. Embassy in Beijing said by telephone on Wednesday.</p>
</text>
